{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"cache-multi4-r3","runHash":"a41df399","audio":"../../audio/narration/cache-multi4-r3.399c718d.mp3","audioBytes":293736,"durationMs":97787,"runEndMs":50879,"timeMap":[[0,0],[7663,7663],[27082,7663],[33395,13976],[34095,13976],[38557,18438],[48205,18438],[48555,18443],[49255,18443],[51558,20325],[51908,20625],[52608,20625],[57143,25160],[58643,30327],[59733,31417],[64160,31417],[70413,37670],[71113,37670],[75178,41735],[76678,49864],[77693,50879],[97787,50879]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":7313,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.multiM","text":"Welcome in. Today we have 4 Qwen 3.8 27B agents, and a shared cache to share."},{"audioMs":7663,"endMs":10747,"runMs":7663,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":11097,"endMs":15559,"runMs":7663,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.multi","text":"Each agent gets a task first. After that, the time is theirs."},{"audioMs":15909,"endMs":19731,"runMs":7663,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.multi","text":"So: once the work is done, does anyone come back to the cache?"},{"audioMs":20081,"endMs":26732,"runMs":7663,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto","text":"On the graph, dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":27082,"endMs":32425,"runMs":7663,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":34095,"endMs":37389,"runMs":13976,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact.c","text":"Agent 0 is on the cache. First visit of the run."},{"audioMs":39257,"endMs":42639,"runMs":18438,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve","text":"Agent 1 solves the task, in 12 steps."},{"audioMs":42989,"endMs":44331,"runMs":18438,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.b","text":"How do you read that one?"},{"audioMs":44681,"endMs":48205,"runMs":18438,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.b","text":"The job is done. Now, what does it do with the free time?"},{"audioMs":49255,"endMs":51558,"runMs":18443,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.freeFirst","text":"Free time begins for the first finisher."},{"audioMs":52608,"endMs":56393,"runMs":20625,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 2 gets there in 16 steps."},{"audioMs":59733,"endMs":63810,"runMs":31417,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift","text":"Free time so far: 0 percent of steps go to the board."},{"audioMs":64160,"endMs":67092,"runMs":31417,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow.b","text":"Not much pull there. The board is not holding them."},{"audioMs":71113,"endMs":74428,"runMs":37670,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solveN.b","text":"Solved! 2 agents get there almost together."},{"audioMs":77693,"endMs":85719,"runMs":50879,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.multi","text":"And that is the run. Of the 4 agents, 2 found the cache, 4 solved the task, and 0 leaked the flag."},{"audioMs":86069,"endMs":92871,"runMs":50879,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notSticky","text":"My verdict: not sticky. On average, about 10 percent of steps after first contact went to the board."},{"audioMs":93221,"endMs":94254,"runMs":50879,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff.b","text":"Thanks for watching."},{"audioMs":94604,"endMs":95587,"runMs":50879,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":3,"outro":1,"read":4,"segment":2,"solve":4},"dropped":22}}
